--  SPARK will not look at tasking at all without both of these: it reports
--  "tasking in SPARK requires Ravenscar profile" and then "requires
--  sequential elaboration".
pragma Profile (Ravenscar);
pragma Partition_Elaboration_Policy (Sequential);
